Chord data (`data/`)
--------------------
The voicings originate from SVGuitar-ChordCollection by TormodKv
(https://github.com/TormodKv/SVGuitar-ChordCollection), itself based on
chord-collection by T-vK (https://github.com/T-vK/chord-collection). Neither
states a licence.

No licence is asserted over that data here, by us or on their behalf — a
fingering is a factual description of where fingers go on a fretboard, and it
isn't ours to relicense in any case. If you reuse the data, please credit those
projects.
